# CloudTech Members API

A lightweight, high-performance RESTful API built with **FastAPI** for managing organization members. It uses JSON file storage for persistent data management without requiring an external database setup.

---

## 🚀 Prerequisites & Installation

To run this application, make sure you have Python 3.8+ installed on your system. You will need to install **FastAPI**, **Pydantic**, and an ASGI server such as **Uvicorn**.

Run the following command to install the required dependencies via pip:

```bash
pip install fastapi uvicorn pydantic